 "notes": "Provider regions are not observable (the ground truth's planned VPCs carry no region attribute), so the us-east-1 and secondary-region targets are unchecked. Default tags are checked via tags_all; aliases via the declared provider meta-argument, tied to each VPC by its CIDR or its Name tag (the CIDR is often held in a local). two_vpcs requires VPCs declared on at least two different provider configurations. The provider aliases are core: two named provider configurations are the point of the scenario."
